  "change_summary": [
    "Own installable CLI Agent and Windows Desktop sharing one core and session authority",
    "Local inventory, targeted research, upstream reuse and evidence-bound custom gaps for every new project",
    "Mu fixed combination first; Pi plus existing Desktop alternative; QM optional remote adapter",
    "P01-P07 and B01-B02 mapped into the existing 22 tasks and 42 formal cases",
    "Explicit local client protocol, payload schemas, capability mapping and six protocol fixtures",
    "Jev reuse_selection judgment with hard gates, independent review and legal zero-adoption outcomes",
    "Inspection clones distinguished from stable adoption; fork or source-module adaptation after evidence-based selection",
    "Skill-up prioritized for bounded W15 qualification through W10; raw reports preserve all variants and iterations",
    "17 primary documents, four J capability assertions and 12 adoption fixtures; five-part specification kept complete"
  ],
